Subject: Allow the supported builder SDK

Upstream pins SDK 9 with feature-band roll-forward. Permit major-version
roll-forward so the supported .NET 10 builder can build the same targets.

diff --git a/global.json b/global.json
--- a/global.json
+++ b/global.json
@@ -2,6 +2,6 @@
   "sdk": {
     "version": "9.0.100",
     "allowPrerelease": false,
-    "rollForward": "latestFeature"
+    "rollForward": "latestMajor"
   }
 }
